            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "bq. Spatial could really use some love\n\nI agree.  There are also some spooky issues opened on it, eg LUCENE-1781, LUCENE-1815.\n\nI think we should somehow call this out in the javadocs... at least declaring the whole package experimental for starters?",
